{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "忘", "id": "忘"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "殉", "id": "殉"}, {"form": "登", "id": "登"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.4586150226995167, "source": "信", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.8449093838194073, "source": "信", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.355735007585398, "source": "信", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.6409365794934714, "source": "恥", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.9286186519452522, "source": "恥", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.4586150226995167, "source": "志", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.355735007585398, "source": "志", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.235471471385307, "source": "人", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "人", "target": "忘"}, {"weight": 0.07232066157962608, "source": "人", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "人", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.4586150226995167, "source": "人", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "人", "target": "歸"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "人", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "人", "target": "殉"}, {"weight": 1.5921464153240394, "source": "居", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.4289956055183586, "source": "居", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.9502698994772336, "source": "忘", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 2.66258782702545